cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "21st Century Supermoon Estimation in R"
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Travis
    family-names: Stenborg
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2693-9628"
url: "https://github.com/tstenborg/supermoon"
abstract: >-
  "This repository holds digital assets associated with the article '21st \
  Century Supermoon Estimation in R'. That article presents a supermoon \
  estimator, software that predicts the timing and distance of a perigee full \
  or new moon for 2001 to 2100. Estimates include formal uncertainties."
keywords:
  - astronomy
  - moon
  - r
